<title>NETHERLANDS: WOLTERS ACQUIRES FRENCH MEDICAL PUBLISHER.</title>
<headline>WOLTERS ACQUIRES FRENCH MEDICAL PUBLISHER.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wolters Kluwer NV said on Thursday it had acquired French medical publisher Arnette Blackwell S.A. from Blackwell Sciences Ltd.</p>
<p>The Dutch publisher said Arnette Blackwell had annual sales of some 35 million French francs or 11.5 million Dutch guilders.</p>
